Subject: [PATCH 1/3] inverse guard + beat acceptance: copy cannot outrun its
 beat

inverse_findings: zero digits; names only sentence-initial/exempt/
corpus/arc-allowlist (data-derived). voice_accept routes bt_ ids
(refuses proposed beats, stale beat_hash); validate_voice gates the
pack beats section. Selftest demonstrates the documented limit.

